1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 24=

4
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:00,300
Your Highness.

5
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:01,970
The auspicious hour is approaching.

6
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:03,850
Please put on your bridal veil.

7
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,370
Leave us.

8
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,460
What did you do to him?

9
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,970
I merely returned everything

10
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,430
he did to me
over those thirty-three lifetimes.

11
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:25,500
Xiaoyuan.

12
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:27,630
Now that he's dead,

13
00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:29,070
you can finally rest easy.

14
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:31,220
Now,

15
00:01:32,630 --> 00:01:33,990
it's time for our wedding ceremony.

16
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:36,140
Let go of me!

17
00:01:43,470 --> 00:01:44,350
Zhao Boqing.

18
00:02:06,910 --> 00:02:07,790
I thought...

19
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:09,100
I thought...

20
00:02:09,430 --> 00:02:10,300
I promised you

21
00:02:10,910 --> 00:02:11,790
that this life

22
00:02:12,380 --> 00:02:13,190
would be different.

23
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:15,180
(Half an hour earlier)
His Majesty has given the order.

24
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,630
Send the Seventh Prince to his death.

25
00:02:33,470 --> 00:02:33,940
Your Highness.

26
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,030
I'm late.

27
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:45,790
I was right about you after all.

28
00:02:47,790 --> 00:02:48,940
I've served Your Highness for years.

29
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:49,940
I knew

30
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:51,420
you must have had a plan.

31
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:54,220
I

32
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,540
may appear to have saved Your Highness,

33
00:02:55,820 --> 00:02:56,470
but in truth,

34
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,260
I saved myself.

35
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,190
What matters is that
you've come to your senses.

36
00:03:02,070 --> 00:03:02,790
Yes.

37
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:04,420
I, Fu Yang,

38
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:06,260
pledge to remain by Your Highness's side

39
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:08,150
and help safeguard Great Yue.

40
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:15,420
Fu Yang.

41
00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:17,260
How dare you betray me?

42
00:03:17,790 --> 00:03:18,310
Your Highness.

43
00:03:18,980 --> 00:03:20,750
Do you know why my father, Zhixuan,

44
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,980
chose you

45
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:24,150
to bear the painful memories
of those thirty-three lifetimes?

46
00:03:24,350 --> 00:03:25,260
Because

47
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:27,660
what he needed was never a wise ruler,

48
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:29,630
but the perfect weapon,

49
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:33,030
one that could eliminate
the true imperial star for him.

50
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,540
Nonsense!

51
00:03:36,070 --> 00:03:37,220
I am the Crown Prince,

52
00:03:37,790 --> 00:03:39,030
the rightful heir by destiny.

53
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:40,420
But did you know

54
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:41,870
your own star of destiny is dim?

55
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:44,470
Even if you ascend the throne,
you're destined to die young.

56
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:46,420
Your mother's family suffers
from a blood-clotting disorder.

57
00:03:46,790 --> 00:03:48,260
None of the men live past thirty-five.

58
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,870
The late Empress
falsified the medical records

59
00:03:49,980 --> 00:03:51,220
and hid the truth from His Majesty.

60
00:03:51,630 --> 00:03:52,500
Recently,

61
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:54,750
have your wounds been slow to heal?

62
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,220
Have you often felt unusually cold?

63
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:58,310
No.

64
00:04:01,070 --> 00:04:01,870
That's impossible.

65
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:03,260
Zhuguang.

66
00:04:03,790 --> 00:04:04,470
Give the signal.

67
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:05,750
Kill

68
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:06,750
all these rebels!

69
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:09,350
His Majesty has arrived!

70
00:04:11,070 --> 00:04:11,870
Your Majesty.

71
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:13,700
Your Majesty?

72
00:04:15,070 --> 00:04:16,070
You unfilial son.

73
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:18,980
Who exactly are the rebels here?

74
00:04:19,470 --> 00:04:20,260
Father.

75
00:04:22,590 --> 00:04:23,630
How could you...

76
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:27,260
What's going on?

77
00:04:27,350 --> 00:04:28,150
Father.

78
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:30,420
You've been unconscious
for days from poisoning.

79
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:32,420
Miss He came up with a plan

80
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:34,030
to have the Imperial Physician
enter in disguise,

81
00:04:34,420 --> 00:04:35,470
and that's how you were revived.

82
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:38,910
Who dared poison me?

83
00:04:40,870 --> 00:04:41,610
The poison

84
00:04:41,750 --> 00:04:43,860
was mixed into the ginseng soup
you drank every day.

85
00:04:44,590 --> 00:04:45,950
The one who poisoned you

86
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:48,300
was the Crown Prince.

87
00:04:48,420 --> 00:04:49,390
Nonsense!

88
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:50,950
Crown Prince...

89
00:04:50,950 --> 00:04:51,860
Father.

90
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:53,540
At first, I didn't
want to believe it either.

91
00:04:53,740 --> 00:04:55,220
But not only did Brother poison you,

92
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:56,220
he also issued a false imperial edict

93
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:57,470
to have Boqing killed.

94
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:59,590
He even agreed to cede territory
and pay reparations to the northern border.

95
00:05:00,030 --> 00:05:00,950
He went so far

96
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:03,540
as to send me away
in a marriage alliance.

97
00:05:05,270 --> 00:05:05,950
Father.

98
00:05:06,150 --> 00:05:07,590
Please see for yourself,

99
00:05:07,790 --> 00:05:08,950
and you'll know whether it's true.

100
00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:11,910
That...

101
00:05:12,420 --> 00:05:13,790
unfilial son!

102
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,150
Crown Prince.

103
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,620
You poisoned your own father,

104
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:18,860
framed your brother,

105
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:20,470
and ceded territory to buy peace.

106
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,860
Every one of these acts

107
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:24,030
violates both the law
and the bonds of family.

108
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:30,740
Do you admit your crimes?

109
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:34,030
Father.

110
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:35,270
Every wrong committed

111
00:05:35,590 --> 00:05:37,030
was mine alone.

112
00:05:37,030 --> 00:05:38,620
You may punish me however you wish.

113
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:39,710
I only ask

114
00:05:40,830 --> 00:05:42,030
that you spare everyone else.

115
00:05:42,350 --> 00:05:43,620
By my decree,

116
00:05:44,270 --> 00:05:46,270
Zhao Junyao is stripped
of his title as Crown Prince

117
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:47,390
and removed from the imperial clan.

118
00:05:48,300 --> 00:05:49,980
He and his attendant Shen Zhuguang

119
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:51,350
are to be confined to the Eastern Palace

120
00:05:51,590 --> 00:05:52,950
until further judgment.

121
00:05:57,060 --> 00:05:58,180
Seventh Prince,

122
00:05:58,660 --> 00:05:59,710
Zhao Boqing,

123
00:06:03,790 --> 00:06:04,860
from this day forward,

124
00:06:04,860 --> 00:06:06,060
shall succeed as Crown Prince

125
00:06:06,270 --> 00:06:07,790
and oversee the affairs of state.

126
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:13,980
The future of the realm

127
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,620
now rests with you.

128
00:06:15,620 --> 00:06:17,140
(Imperial)

129
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:22,470
I will

130
00:06:23,790 --> 00:06:25,470
never fail our realm or its people.

131
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:42,710
Fu Yang rendered meritorious service
in protecting the Emperor.

132
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:44,470
Choose an auspicious day

133
00:06:44,470 --> 00:06:45,860
for him to marry the Princess.

134
00:06:47,270 --> 00:06:48,220
Thank you, Your Majesty.

135
00:06:48,270 --> 00:06:49,150
Thank you, Father.

136
00:06:52,790 --> 00:06:54,140
You may all rise.

137
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:20,350
Your Highness.

138
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:22,350
Have something to eat.

139
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:24,830
You didn't leave?

140
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,830
The Seventh Prince let me in.

141
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:29,740
He said

142
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:31,660
you needed someone to attend to you.

143
00:07:35,350 --> 00:07:37,030
Did he send you to keep an eye on me?

144
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:39,270
Or did you come to gloat?

145
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:42,740
If the Seventh Prince
truly wanted you dead,

146
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,290
do you think the Eastern Palace

147
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:45,860
would still have a warm brazier and bed?

148
00:07:46,470 --> 00:07:47,270
Fine.

149
00:07:48,420 --> 00:07:49,620
How much did he reward you?

150
00:07:51,170 --> 00:07:52,830
Now that you mention it,

151
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:55,270
attending to the Crown Prince
is quite demanding.

152
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:57,470
I should ask
the Seventh Prince for more.

153
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,830
But come to think of it,

154
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,470
I want for nothing here in the palace,

155
00:08:02,790 --> 00:08:04,420
so I don't really need the money.

156
00:08:07,590 --> 00:08:09,030
Then you must have heard

157
00:08:10,470 --> 00:08:11,860
that I have a blood-clotting disorder

158
00:08:12,790 --> 00:08:13,790
and won't live past thirty-five.

159
00:08:15,980 --> 00:08:16,860
Even better.

160
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:18,740
It's not contagious anyway.

161
00:08:19,790 --> 00:08:22,100
Could Your Highness live
a few more years for my sake

162
00:08:22,620 --> 00:08:24,420
so I can earn rewards
for a few more years?

163
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,840
♪How long can it last?♪

164
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:27,660
Mu Tingting.

165
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:29,550
♪Before sorrow sets in♪

166
00:08:29,570 --> 00:08:30,390
I remember you saying

167
00:08:30,710 --> 00:08:32,030
you wanted to be
the Crown Prince's concubine.

168
00:08:32,470 --> 00:08:33,590
But in my heart,

169
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:36,420
you deserve to be more
than just a concubine.

170
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:39,910
Have you fallen for me, Your Highness?

171
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:41,590
I...

172
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,540
I don't know.

173
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:51,000
♪I don't know how to love in moderation♪

174
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,560
♪Nor do I understand
playing hard to get♪

175
00:08:54,890 --> 00:08:58,420
♪Even the right way to love you♪

176
00:08:58,630 --> 00:09:01,940
♪I still don't understand♪

177
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:04,270
Since Your Highness doesn't know,

178
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:07,540
then start loving me
from this moment on.

179
00:09:08,180 --> 00:09:08,990
How about it?

180
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:12,400
♪Only after all the love has faded♪

181
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:15,220
♪Do I learn to understand♪

182
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:18,570
♪I don't know how to love in moderation♪

183
00:09:18,690 --> 00:09:22,270
♪Nor do I understand
playing hard to get♪

184
00:09:22,610 --> 00:09:26,070
♪Even the right way to love you♪

185
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:29,990
♪I still don't understand♪

186
00:09:30,050 --> 00:09:33,460
♪I don't know what's on your mind♪

187
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:36,700
♪Or how to hold on
to this fluttering feeling♪

188
00:09:37,230 --> 00:09:39,110
So the true love
I've been searching so hard for

189
00:09:40,060 --> 00:09:41,270
was right in front of me all along.

190
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:43,580
How could I have been so foolish
not to realize it until now?

191
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,420
Tingting.

192
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:47,300
Why do I always feel

193
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,510
that many years ago,

194
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:50,630
I had already fallen in love with you

195
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,030
and loved you for a very long time?

196
00:09:57,660 --> 00:09:58,990
I was too forward.

197
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:00,660
I spoke without restraint.

198
00:10:01,460 --> 00:10:02,270
You weren't.

199
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:05,390
Because, as it happens,

200
00:10:05,940 --> 00:10:06,940
I feel the same way.

201
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:09,730
♪Only after all the love has faded♪

202
00:10:09,730 --> 00:10:12,690
♪Do I learn to understand♪

203
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:18,580
Zhao Boqing.

204
00:10:19,630 --> 00:10:21,420
I heard you've announced

205
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:22,940
that Zhao Junyao
died after a long illness.

206
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:25,300
By nature, he

207
00:10:25,460 --> 00:10:26,460
is kindhearted and gentle.

208
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,630
He was never meant to be trapped
within the imperial family.

209
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:43,420
Let's go.

210
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:53,700
Everything

211
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:54,870
is finally over.

212
00:10:59,710 --> 00:11:01,540
I feel as though
I've forgotten something.

213
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:03,150
Forgotten what?

214
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:04,230
Don't scare me.

215
00:11:05,820 --> 00:11:07,180
We still have to explain to your parents

216
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:10,700
how you went
from the former Crown Princess

217
00:11:11,580 --> 00:11:12,460
to the Empress.

218
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:21,940
My sister and my parents
are entering the palace today.

219
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:24,180
That's a rather complicated story.

220
00:11:25,390 --> 00:11:26,750
Tell me,

221
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:28,990
which lifetime should we start with?

222
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:35,990
I'll just say

223
00:11:36,630 --> 00:11:38,030
the Seventh Prince

224
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,340
fell for his sister-in-law
at first sight

225
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:42,340
and seduced her.

226
00:11:43,970 --> 00:11:46,290
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

227
00:11:46,650 --> 00:11:48,030
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

228
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:48,750
Silly He.

229
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:50,270
You're getting bolder again.

230
00:11:52,490 --> 00:11:56,810
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

231
00:11:56,810 --> 00:11:59,570
♪My heart has long known♪

232
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:02,010
♪We made a promise long ago♪

233
00:12:02,330 --> 00:12:03,930
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

234
00:12:04,610 --> 00:12:07,930
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

235
00:12:08,250 --> 00:12:11,090
♪How much must I let go♪

236
00:12:11,410 --> 00:12:13,090
♪For one moment♪

237
00:12:13,370 --> 00:12:15,660
♪To hold each other close♪

238
00:12:16,330 --> 00:12:18,180
♪Would that be enough?♪

239
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:32,960
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

240
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:35,000
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

241
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:38,640
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

242
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:43,480
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

243
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:46,240
♪My heart has long known♪

244
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,680
♪We made a promise long ago♪

245
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:50,600
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

246
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:54,600
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

247
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:57,760
♪How much must I let go♪

248
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,760
♪For one moment♪

249
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:02,760
♪To hold each other close♪

250
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:07,320
♪Would that be enough?♪
